*EXP. DATA (T): UFGA2402 lettuce observed time-course (updated, unit-converted, all replicate grows)
! Rebuilt from observed_daily_wide_dssat.csv. ONE ROW PER REPLICATE GROW (no averaging).
! TRNO mapping: 1=21C BG, 2=21C WG, 3=25C BG, 4=25C WG, 5=31C BG, 6=31C WG, 7=34C BG, 8=34C WG
!   (BG = BG23-1251, WG = Waldmann's Green)
! GROW = replicate grow ID (3 grows per treatment); rows share TRNO/DATE across reps, GROW distinguishes them.
! DATE = YYDDD nominal cycle (YY=24); planting DOY by temperature 21C=001, 25C=043, 31C=085, 34C=127.
!        Treatments 5-8 were grown in 2025 but coded under nominal year 24, as in source UFGA2402.LUX.
! DAS  = days after transplant (= raw days-after-sowing - 13; seedlings were 14 d old at transplant).
! Missing value = -99. Values rounded to 3 decimals.
! CWAD  = canopy dry weight (kg[dm]/ha); from dry biomass g/plant x 16 plants/m2 x 10
! FCWAM = fresh tops weight (kg/ha); from fresh weight g/plant x 16 plants/m2 x 10
! LAID  = leaf area index (m2 leaf/m2 ground); mean of individual destructively-
!         sampled plants' leaf-based LAI estimates (leaf_area_m2/avg_ground_area_m2
!         per plant) per TRNO/GROW/DAS, from photos_with_LAI.csv (added 2026-08-05).
! CHTD  = canopy height (m); from plant height cm / 100
! LN%D  = leaf nitrogen concentration (% dry matter)
! EPAA  = avg plant transpiration (mm/d); from evap-corrected transpiration g/plant/d x 16 / 1000
! Source: observed_daily_wide_dssat.csv (planting density 16 plants/m2).
! PHAN  = canopy gross photosynthesis, noon (mg CO2/m2/s); added 2026-08-04 from
!         licor-complete-dataset.csv (LI-COR 6800 leaf gas exchange, column A,
!         umol CO2/m2 LEAF/s), converted mg=umol*0.04401 and averaged per
!         TRNO+DAS across all measured leaves/reps for that day. CAVEAT: this
!         is a single-leaf area-basis rate, not ground-area canopy rate like
!         the model's own PHAN output -- do not treat as a like-for-like
!         Evaluate.OUT match without LAI-based leaf-to-canopy scaling.
!         Verified 2026-08-06: PHAN = mean(column A) grouped by TRNO (treat_ID
!         x Variety, ALL grows sharing that TRNO pooled together) and DAS
!         (raw licor DAS used directly, NO -13 day offset -- unlike every
!         other source file in this folder, the licor DAS column already
!         lines up with LUT DAS as-is). Recomputed from raw and matched every
!         existing PHAN value exactly; no missing DAS points found, so no
!         PHAN values were added or changed in this update.
! ---- 2026-08-06 update: renamed SLAVR->SLAD (see above). photos_height.csv
!      has one unmerged height observation outside the existing t1 grows
!      (TRNO 3/4, g6, DAS 3, split by variety: bg 0.043 m, wg 0.025 m) but it
!      was left out of the T-file as a single isolated DAS point with no
!      surrounding time series to support it. No other columns had addable
!      data: N% (LN%D/CN%D) has no source outside t1 (grows g3-g5) in
!      plant_nutrition_dataset.csv; stomatal/canopy conductance (gsw/gtw in
!      licor-complete-dataset.csv), SPAD, leaf thickness, and the mineral
!      panel (B,Ca,Cu,Fe,K,Mg,Mn,Mo,P,Zn) have no matching DATA.CDE code and
!      were left out of the T-file on that basis.
! ---- 2026-08-06 update: dropped two SLAD outliers at DAS1 for grow g4
!      (TRNO1=1757.006, TRNO2=4225.760), then all remaining DAS1 SLAD values
!      file-wide (13 more), then the whole SLAD column was removed outright.
!      Root cause: SLAD = leaf_area / canopy_dry_weight, and dry weight at
!      DAS14 raw (transplant day) is recorded to only 0.01g resolution
!      against actual masses of 0.01-0.12g for EVERY grow, not just g4 --
!      confirmed systemic, not a per-grow anomaly, via biomass_complete_
!      dataset.csv. Rather than keep patching individual bad values, the
!      column was dropped entirely. LAID is unaffected (uses a constant
!      planting-density ground-area denominator, not dry weight, so it
!      doesn't share this failure mode).
! CWID  = canopy width (m); from avg_diameter_m in photos_with_LAI.csv
!         (equivalent-circle diameter of projected ground area, 2*sqrt(area/pi)),
!         averaged across sampled plants per TRNO/GROW/DAS. Only the destructive
!         sampling days (DAS 1/8/15/22) carry values; added 2026-08-07.
@TRNO  GROW   DATE  DAS      CWAD      FCWAM   LAID    CHTD   LN%D    EPAA    PHAN     CWID
